config-connector-extensions patch 0025: mockgcp serves an organization's address groups.

For networksecurity.gcp.hfl.dev NetworkSecurityAddressGroup with an
organization parent. Written here: mocknetworksecurity/organizationaddressgroup.go
registers the OrganizationAddressGroupService
(/v1/{parent=organizations/*/locations/*}/addressGroups) and serves its
create, get, update and delete with the project service's
AddressGroupServer, which takes any parent, and adds it to the HTTP mux
by its full name (the client's methods match the project service's
too); the item methods (addItems,
removeItems, cloneItems, listReferences) are not served. Upstream
candidate: yes.

